   "source": [
    "Le formule teoriche della frizione dinamica per velocità generiche, basse e alte, assieme alle versioni usate per eseguire dei fit e verificare gli andamenti con le giuste potenze sono le seguenti:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "097db767",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\\begin{align}\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "a(\\vec{v}_s) = - 4\\pi G^2 M_s  m n\\ln(\\Lambda)  \\left[\\textrm{erf}(X)-\\frac{2X}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-X^2}\\right] \\frac{\\vec{v}_s}{v_s^3}  \n",
    "\\quad &\\longleftrightarrow  \\quad  \\frac{c_0}{(x-c_1)^2} \\left[\\textrm{erf}(X)-\\frac{2X}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-X^2}\\right]  + c_2 \\\\\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "a(\\vec{v}_s)  \\simeq - \\frac{-16 \\pi^2 }{3} G^2 M_s m_a \\ln{\\Lambda} f(0) \\vec{v}_s  \\quad &\\longleftrightarrow  \\quad c_0 x + c_1 \\\\\n",
    " \n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "a(\\vec{v}_s) = -4 \\pi G^2 M_s m_a n\\ln{\\Lambda}  \\frac{\\vec{v}_s}{v_s^3}   \\quad &\\longleftrightarrow  \\quad \\frac{c_0}{(x-c_2)^2}+c_1 \\\\\n",
    "\\end{align}\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "<!-- (v_s \\quad \\text{general}) \\quad \\quad \n",
    "(v_s \\quad \\text{small}) \\quad \\quad \n",
    "\\quad (v_s \\quad \\text{large}) -->\n",
    "con\n",
    "\n",
    "$$X = \\frac{v_s}{\\sqrt{2} \\sigma}$$"
   ]
  },
